\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang1040\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Who is He, in yonder stall
\par At whose feet the shepherds fall?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par 'Tis the Lord! O wondrous story!
\par 'Tis the Lord, the King of Glory!
\par At His feet we humbly fall;
\par Crown Him, Crown Him Lord of all.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\i0\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Who is He, in yonder cot,
\par Bending to His toilsome lot?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par 'Tis the Lord! O wondrous story!
\par 'Tis the Lord, the King of Glory!
\par At His feet we humbly fall;
\par Crown Him, Crown Him Lord of all.
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Who is He, in deep distress,
\par Fasting in the wilderness?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par 'Tis the Lord! O wondrous story!
\par 'Tis the Lord, the King of Glory!
\par At His feet we humbly fall;
\par Crown Him, Crown Him Lord of all.
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Who is He that stands and weeps
\par At the grave where Lazarus sleeps?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par 'Tis the Lord! O wondrous story!
\par 'Tis the Lord, the King of Glory!
\par At His feet we humbly fall;
\par Crown Him, Crown Him Lord of all.\i0 
\par \pard\fi720 
\par \pard\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Lo, at midnight, who is He
\par Prays in dark Gethsemane?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par 'Tis the Lord! O wondrous story!
\par 'Tis the Lord, the King of Glory!
\par At His feet we humbly fall;
\par Crown Him, Crown Him Lord of all.
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Who is He, in Calvary's throes,
\par Asks for the blessings on His foes?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par 'Tis the Lord! O wondrous story!
\par 'Tis the Lord, the King of Glory!
\par At His feet we humbly fall;
\par Crown Him, Crown Him Lord of all.
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7. Who is He that from the grave
\par Comes to heal and help and save?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par 'Tis the Lord! O wondrous story!
\par 'Tis the Lord, the King of Glory!
\par At His feet we humbly fall;
\par Crown Him, Crown Him Lord of all.
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 8\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 8. Who is He that from His throne
\par Rules through all the worlds alone?
\par \lang1033 
\par \cf1\lang1040\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par 'Tis the Lord! O wondrous story!
\par 'Tis the Lord, the King of Glory!
\par At His feet we humbly fall;
\par Crown Him, Crown Him Lord of all.
